          "zh": [
            "AlphaGenome Atlas 绘制单字母 DNA 变异的分子效应图谱。",
            "它涵盖了 90 亿个单字母 DNA 变化。",
            "该资源是人类基因组中每一个可能的单字母 DNA 变化的预测图谱。"
          ]
        },
        "impact": {
          "en": "This release provides a comprehensive predictive resource for genetic research, enabling AI models to analyze and understand the functional consequences of DNA variations on a large scale.",
          "zh": "这一发布为基因研究提供了全面的预测资源，使人工智能模型能够大规模分析和理解 DNA 变异的功能后果。"
        },
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
